-zhao:m028-0152","start":152,"end":155,"surface":"當道者","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0206","start":206,"end":209,"surface":"當道者","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0270","start":270,"end":273,"surface":"當道者","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0335","start":335,"end":338,"surface":"當道者","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-075","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","surfaces":["有人","當道者"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p028","quote":"他日，簡子出，有人當道，辟之不去，從者怒，將刃之。當道者曰：「吾欲有謁於主君。」從者以聞。簡子召之，曰：「譆，吾有所見子晣也。」當道者曰：「屛左右，願有謁。」簡子屛人。當道者曰：「主君之疾，臣在帝側。」簡子曰：「然，有之。子之見我，我何爲？」當道者曰：「帝令主君射熊與羆，皆死。」簡子曰：「是，且何也？」當道者曰：「晉國且有大難，主君首之。帝令主君滅二卿，夫熊與羆皆其祖也。」簡子曰：「帝賜我二笥皆有副，何也？」當道者曰：「主君之子將克二國於翟，皆子姓也。」簡子曰：「吾見兒在帝側，帝屬我一翟犬，曰『及而子之長以賜之』。夫兒何謂以賜翟犬？」當道者曰：「兒，主君之子也。翟犬者，代之先也。主君之子且必有代。及主君之後嗣，且有革政而胡服，并二國於翟。」簡子問其姓而延之以官。當道者曰：「臣野人，致帝命耳。」遂不見。簡子書藏之府。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為及連續事件判讀；夢辭人物與實際敘事分層，知伯文子未與荀櫟僅按熟知身份合併，氏族合稱保持未定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p028","text":"他日，簡子出，有人當道，辟之不去，從者怒，將刃之。當道者曰：「吾欲有謁於主君。」從者以聞。簡子召之，曰：「譆，吾有所見子晣也。」當道者曰：「屛左右，願有謁。」簡子屛人。當道者曰：「主君之疾，臣在帝側。」簡子曰：「然，有之。子之見我，我何爲？」當道者曰：「帝令主君射熊與羆，皆死。」簡子曰：「是，且何也？」當道者曰：「晉國且有大難，主君首之。帝令主君滅二卿，夫熊與羆皆其祖也。」簡子曰：「帝賜我二笥皆有副，何也？」當道者曰：「主君之子將克二國於翟，皆子姓也。」簡子曰：「吾見兒在帝側，帝屬我一翟犬，曰『及而子之長以賜之』。夫兒何謂以賜翟犬？」當道者曰：「兒，主君之子也。翟犬者，代之先也。主君之子且必有代。及主君之後嗣，且有革政而胡服，并二國於翟。」簡子問其姓而延之以官。當道者曰：「臣野人，致帝命耳。」遂不見。簡子書藏之府。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"有人","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"從者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神異預言、職稱或未定指代；不從夢辭補人物世系，不把范中行氏族字面全域當個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"當道者","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"主君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神異預言、職稱或未定指代；不從夢辭補人物世系，不把范中行氏族字面全域當個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"從者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神異預言、職稱或未定指代；不從夢辭補人物世系，不把范中行氏族字面全域當個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"當道者","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"當道者","kind":"person","person_id":"dhu_m3k_yii","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m028-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"主君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、